A number leaves a remainder of 5 when divided by 12. What remainder will 3 times that number leave when divided by 12?
A) 1
B) 3
C) 5
D) 7
Solution :
         $$ N=12k+5 $$

Three times the number:

$$ 3N=3(12k+5) $$ $$ =36k+15 $$

Since 36k is divisible by 12:

$$ 15\div12 \text{ leaves remainder } \boxed{3} $$

Difficulty: Easy–Medium

Answer: D) 3
